+tag                 K  primes         status
+MOD_K8_PIN_LIGHT2   8  32003,32009    both fibres killed with returncode -9 after 482.61s
+MOD_K9_PIN_LIGHT2   9  32003          killed with returncode -9 during prelude after rho markers
